  "mechanism": "Waiter::pause_timeout returns ETIME whenever the timer has expired after wakeup. Pollable::wait_events propagates it without rerunning the readiness closure, and do_epoll_pwait2 and do_poll map ETIME to 0, so readiness that woke the waiter before the deadline is reported as a timeout when the waiter runs late.",
  "sites": [
    "kernel/core/src/process/signal/pause.rs::Waiter::pause_timeout",
    "kernel/core/src/process/signal/poll.rs::Pollable::wait_events",
    "kernel/core/src/events/epoll/file.rs::EpollFile::wait",
    "kernel/core/src/syscall/epoll.rs::do_epoll_pwait2",
    "kernel/core/src/syscall/poll.rs::do_poll",
    "kernel/core/src/syscall/select.rs::do_sys_select"
  ],
