  "contract": "epoll_wait(2)/poll(2)/select(2): 0 means no descriptor became ready before the timeout. Readiness that occurred before the deadline must be returned even if the waiter runs after it.",
  "observed": "With the waiter delayed past its 200 ms deadline by a SCHED_FIFO writer that wrote the pipe before the deadline, epoll_pwait and pselect6 (and epoll_wait/ppoll on one vCPU) return 0 and an immediate zero-timeout retry reports the pipe ready.",
